&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-669947-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. Unknown Threat Organization&lt;/div&gt;
