						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>Hello there!</span></h1> </div> <p>This page is filled with art that can be described as Good, Cursed, or Cool but you'll be the Judge so shall stumble in.</p> <div id="wiki-tabview-8a77bff7ea5c6b6a7ad38d95746d45f6" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Padoru</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Characters</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>Pictures of the Varies Anomalies and or Events surrounding said anomalies.</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>- <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-662">SCP-662</a>/<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-113">SCP-113</a> - Mrs.Deeds</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/662"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/662/medium.jpg" alt="662" class="image" /></a><br /> Yes I know the stone is not here but please give me a better explanation, I'll wait</div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4795">SCP-4795</a> - Feathered F(r)iends-</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/4795"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/4795/medium.jpg" alt="4795" class="image" /></a><br /> This was a gift for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297782" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span> for the Art Exchange</div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5366">SCP-5366</a> - Until death do us part and every day after -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/5366"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/5366/medium.jpg" alt="5366" class="image" /></a><br /> I'm not proud of this one I don't say this because it's bad because it makes me feel sick in a good way</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p>Christmas the Time of Giving so I'm giving away some Padorus of different Authors or researchers</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>- <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/doctor-cimmerian#pages">Dr. Cimmerian</a> -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/cimmerian"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/cimmerian/medium.jpg" alt="cimmerian" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/a-green-squid-kid-s-arts-n-crafts/comments/show">Dr. Green</a> -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/green"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/green/medium.jpg" alt="green" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/rounderhouse-s-author-page">Rounderhouse</a> -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/rounderhouse"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/rounderhouse/medium.jpg" alt="rounderhouse" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5936">Dr.Asheworth</a> -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/asheworth"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/asheworth/medium.jpg" alt="asheworth" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p>An Arrey of SCP Character in different art styles or doing some weird stuff.</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>- Dr.Cimmerian at a Shooting range -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/shooting"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/shooting/medium.jpg" alt="shooting" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <h3><span>- Dr. Clef and Dr. Iceberg as Chibis -</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakob17-s-art-cavern/chibi"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakob17-s-art-cavern/chibi/medium.jpg" alt="chibi" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297782" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" >Jakob17</a></span></p> 
