						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="danke agent"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:200%;">PROPERTY OF <span style="color: red"><strong>THE SCP FOUNDATION</strong></span>.</span></p> </div> <br /> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/SCP_Foundation_%28emblem%29.svg/200px-SCP_Foundation_%28emblem%29.svg.png" style="filter: invert(1)" alt="200px-SCP_Foundation_%28emblem%29.svg.png" class="image" /></div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:200%;"><span style="color: red">Secure. Contain. Protect.</span></span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">YOU ARE CURRENTLY ACCESSING INFORMATION RELATED TO FOUNDATION AGENT: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span>. ANY ATTEMPTS TO ACQUIRE THIS INFORMATION WITHOUT THE PROPER CLEARANCE WILL BE LOGGED AND TRACKED. YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED.</span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;</span> <tt>Retrieving and compiling available data related to the queried user from online Foundation databases&#8230;</tt></strong><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/scl.png" style="background-color: var(--bgBadgeColor); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="scl.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="scl"> </span></span></span><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/tsf.png" style="background-color: var(--bgBadgeColor); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="tsf.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="tsf"> </span></span></span><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/spa.png" style="background-color: var(--bgBadgeColor); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="spa.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="spa"> </span></span></span></div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>SCP ARTICLES:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>TALES:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>GOIS:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>COLLABS:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5018" target="_blank">SCP-5018 (FT. IronDruid)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5963" target="_blank">SCP-5963 (FT. Karakatt)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/halfway-lost" target="_blank">Halfway Lost (FT. Greyve, Hexick)</a></li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Personnel&nbsp;Report</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;CLOSE&nbsp;Personnel&nbsp;Report</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>JakdragonX, otherwise known as Jaxon █████, is a Foundation employee originating from the United States. His employment began in August of 2019, where he started as a Junior Researcher in Site 19. JakdragonX has since become a Senior Researcher, and as such has dedicated most of his time towards writing and reviewing documented anomalies.</p> <p>Before his introduction to the Foundation, JakdragonX was an amateur boxer and an avid reader. He enjoys reading, writing, and learning about technology/space. JakdragonX has also shown an interest in pataphysical, ectoentropic, and cyber-related anomalies.</p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Fanart&nbsp;Archives</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp; CLOSE&nbsp;Fanart&nbsp;Archives</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5018.gif" alt="5018.gif" class="image" /><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5158506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Aethris" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5158506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" >Aethris</a></span>. Its fantastic! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5963"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5963/medium.jpg" alt="5963" class="image" /></a><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrails-epsilon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5348862&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Hydrails-EPSILON" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5348862)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrails-epsilon" >Hydrails-EPSILON</a></span>. Its also fantastic! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5850.png" alt="5850.png" class="image" /><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252186&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Dr Whitney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252186)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" >Dr Whitney</a></span>. Some of the coolest fan art I've ever seen! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5346.jpg" alt="5346.jpg" class="image" /><br /> This wonderful watercolored art is provided courtesy of the 2020 SCP Wiki Gift Exchange! It depicts the central anomaly of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5346">SCP-5346</a> and its amazing! Courtesy of the absolutely WONDERFUL <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5963620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Luxaiko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5963620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" >Luxaiko</a></span>!</div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Documentation&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;CLOSE&nbsp;Documentation&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><tt>The following information could not be retrieved. Please, try again later.</tt></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Review&nbsp;From&nbsp;Other&nbsp;Personnel</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;CLOSE&nbsp;Review&nbsp;From&nbsp;Other&nbsp;Personnel</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>&quot;Jak will become the scpd version of paul erdos.&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;Jak is a clueless mfer&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;jak? more like, cringe. Do you even write anything, Yak?&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;Jak is very forgiving and picks awful collab partners&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;jakstrap&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;Jak is a person that exists&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/totallynotenby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5914660&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="totallynotenby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5914660)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/totallynotenby" >totallynotenby</a></span></p> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <p><em>&quot;JakdragonX gets real upset if you spell his name with a capital D. He doesn't realize that it's not the size of the D that matters, but how you use it.&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297787" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;</span> Additional Information:</strong> <p>In the event that you must contact JakdragonX, or otherwise require his assistance/wish to collaborate with him, you can message him using any of these methods:</p> <ol> <li>Discord: JakdragonX#0728</li> <li>IRC: &quot;Jak&quot; (Please Note: Depending on location, time, or situation, this name may change. Please adjust accordingly.)</li> <li>Wikidot: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;ti