ch scene, SCP, or tale it is from,</li> </ul> <ul> <li>Say which tab it goes under,</li> </ul> <ul> <li>Give me your Wikidot username.</li> </ul> <p>You must have all of the above for your art to be submitted to the page.</p> <p><strong>Kara reserves the right to refuse any submission for any reason.</strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-7" style="display:none"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>User</th> <th>Artwork found in</th> <th>Art page / DA</th> <th>Author page</th> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7130109&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297790" alt="Karablue9482" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7130109)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" >Karablue9482</a></span></td> <td>Part One: Doomsday, Part Two: Migration, Intermission, The Birds, and The Extras</td> <td><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/kara-s-page-of-art">Art Page,</a> <a href="https://www.deviantart.com/karalinekatt">My DA</a></td> <td><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/karas-corner-of-doom">My Author Page</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609297790" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" >Jakob17</a></span></td> <td>Season Two: Shock and Terror</td> <td>N/A</td> <td>N/A</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </d